  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "In a world where animal hybrids represent the ultimate elite, Kim Cheol-Su is content living vicariously through his favorite simulation game, \"Wooly Woods\". But his digital hobby becomes a chaotic reality when he finds an abandoned hybrid kitten on his doorstep that looks exactly like his in-game companion. Cheol-Su takes the little one in for temporary protection, but as Na-Bi starts calling him \"Daddy\" and hits an unexpected growth spurt, the responsibilities of a hybrid owner get a lot more hands-on.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
